# Tests for the Qualifying_child module

Run with `clerk test`. Each named scope is one concrete person, worked by
hand from IRC 152(c) and Pub. 501 (2024) pp 11-18 as quoted in
`catala/qualifying_child.catala_en`. Every scope sets satisfiable inputs (a
real person a real filer could enter) and asserts both the expected result
and the rejection of the wrong one. The oracle comparison is
`make difftest-persons` (per-person Direct File values, `oracle/persons.csv`).

> Using Qualifying_child as Q

## Helper: a person with default answers

The default is a biological child born 2010-03-01 (14 at the end of 2024),
who lived with the filer all year, did not provide over half of their own
support, is unmarried, not a student, not disabled, and is nobody else's
qualifying child. The filer (`oldest_filer_dob`) was born 1985-06-15. A test
overrides only what it tests.

```catala
declaration scope MkPerson:
  context relationship content Q.Relationship
  context date_of_birth content date
  context full_time_student content boolean
  context permanent_total_disability content boolean
  context residency_duration content Q.ResidencyDuration
  context own_support content boolean
  context married content boolean
  context writable_joint_return content boolean
  context writable_required_to_file content boolean
  context writable_filing_only_for_refund content boolean
  context could_be_qc_of_another content boolean
  context potential_claimer_must_file content boolean
  context potential_claimer_did_file content boolean
  context potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund content boolean
  output person content Q.Person

scope MkPerson:
  definition relationship equals Q.Relationship.BiologicalChild
  definition date_of_birth equals |2010-03-01|
  definition full_time_student equals false
  definition permanent_total_disability equals false
  definition residency_duration equals Q.ResidencyDuration.AllYear
  definition own_support equals false
  definition married equals false
  definition writable_joint_return equals false
  definition writable_required_to_file equals false
  definition writable_filing_only_for_refund equals false
  definition could_be_qc_of_another equals false
  definition potential_claimer_must_file equals false
  definition potential_claimer_did_file equals false
  definition potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund equals false
  definition person equals Q.Person {
    -- relationship: relationship
    -- date_of_birth: date_of_birth
    -- full_time_student: full_time_student
    -- permanent_total_disability: permanent_total_disability
    -- residency_duration: residency_duration
    -- own_support: own_support
    -- married: married
    -- writable_joint_return: writable_joint_return
    -- writable_required_to_file: writable_required_to_file
    -- writable_filing_only_for_refund: writable_filing_only_for_refund
    -- writable_could_be_qualifying_child_of_another: could_be_qc_of_another
    -- writable_potential_claimer_must_file: potential_claimer_must_file
    -- writable_potential_claimer_did_file: potential_claimer_did_file
    -- writable_potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund:
         potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund
  }
```

## The cases of issue #16

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestEighteenYearOldChild:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestEighteenYearOldChild:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Born 2006-08-20: 18 at the end of 2024, under 19 (152(c)(3)(A)(i)).
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-08-20|
  assertion c.age = 18
  assertion c.age_test
  assertion c.qc_relationship_test
  assertion c.residency_test
  assertion c.qc_support_test
  assertion c.joint_return_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child
  assertion not c.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker

#[test]
declaration scope TestNineteenYearOldNonStudent:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestNineteenYearOldNonStudent:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Born 2005-12-10: turned 19 on December 10, 2024 (Pub 501 p 12 example).
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2005-12-10|
  assertion c.age = 19
  assertion not c.age_test
  # Known-bad output rejected: every other test passes, the age test alone
  # makes the person not a qualifying child.
  assertion c.qc_relationship_test and c.residency_test
    and c.qc_support_test and c.joint_return_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestTwentyTwoYearOldStudent:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestTwentyTwoYearOldStudent:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2002-04-11|
  definition c_p.full_time_student equals true
  assertion c.age = 22
  assertion c.student_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion c.is_a_student_under24
  assertion c.age_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestTwentyTwoYearOldNonStudent:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestTwentyTwoYearOldNonStudent:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Same person, not a student: the known-bad "QC" is rejected.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2002-04-11|
  assertion not c.is_a_student_under24
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestTwentyFourYearOldStudent:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestTwentyFourYearOldStudent:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Born 2000-02-01: 24 at the end of 2024, so not "a student who has not
  # attained the age of 24" (152(c)(3)(A)(ii)).
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2000-02-01|
  definition c_p.full_time_student equals true
  assertion c.age = 24
  assertion not c.student_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion not c.is_a_student_under24
  assertion not c.age_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestDisabledAdultChild:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestDisabledAdultChild:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1959-05-05| }
  # A permanently and totally disabled child aged 40 of a filer aged 65:
  # 152(c)(3)(B), "regardless of age" (Pub 501 p 12).
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |1984-01-20|
  definition c_p.permanent_total_disability equals true
  assertion c.age = 40
  assertion c.disability_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion c.age_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestAdultChildNotDisabled:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestAdultChildNotDisabled:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1959-05-05| }
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |1984-01-20|
  assertion not c.age_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestChildOlderThanFiler:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestChildOlderThanFiler:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |2008-05-01| }
  # A 17-year-old sibling of a 16-year-old filer: under 19 but not younger
  # than the filer (152(c)(3)(A)).
  definition c_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Sibling
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2007-03-01|
  assertion c.age = 17
  assertion not c.younger_than_oldest_filer
  assertion not c.age_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestMarriedJointRefundOnly:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestMarriedJointRefundOnly:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Pub 501 p 15, Example 2: an 18-year-old married child files a joint
  # return only to get a refund of withheld tax and is not required to file.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-02-02|
  definition c_p.married equals true
  definition c_p.writable_joint_return equals true
  definition c_p.writable_required_to_file equals false
  definition c_p.writable_filing_only_for_refund equals true
  assertion c.joint_return
  assertion c.filing_only_for_refund
  assertion c.joint_return_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child
```

## Joint return test: the cases that fail

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestMarriedJointNotRefundOnly:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestMarriedJointNotRefundOnly:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Pub 501 p 15, Example 1: the couple files jointly, not only for a refund.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-02-02|
  definition c_p.married equals true
  definition c_p.writable_joint_return equals true
  assertion not c.joint_return_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestMarriedJointRequiredToFile:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestMarriedJointRequiredToFile:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Required to file: the refund-only exception cannot apply, even if the
  # refund-only box is (inconsistently) answered yes.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-02-02|
  definition c_p.married equals true
  definition c_p.writable_joint_return equals true
  definition c_p.writable_required_to_file equals true
  definition c_p.writable_filing_only_for_refund equals true
  assertion c.required_to_file
  assertion not c.filing_only_for_refund
  assertion not c.joint_return_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestMarriedSeparate:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestMarriedSeparate:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # Married but not filing jointly: passes the joint return test.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-02-02|
  definition c_p.married equals true
  assertion c.joint_return_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestJointAnswersIgnoredIfUnmarried:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestJointAnswersIgnoredIfUnmarried:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # DF ANDs every joint-return fact with `married`.
  definition c_p.writable_joint_return equals true
  definition c_p.writable_required_to_file equals true
  assertion not c.joint_return
  assertion not c.required_to_file
  assertion c.qualifying_child
```

## Relationship, residency and support

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestRelationships:
  child_p scope MkPerson
  internal child content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  step_p scope MkPerson
  internal step content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  foster_p scope MkPerson
  internal foster content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  grand_p scope MkPerson
  internal grand content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  niece_p scope MkPerson
  internal niece content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  half_sibling_child_p scope MkPerson
  internal half_sibling_child content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  in_law_p scope MkPerson
  internal in_law content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  sibling_in_law_p scope MkPerson
  internal sibling_in_law content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  parent_p scope MkPerson
  internal parent content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  aunt_p scope MkPerson
  internal aunt content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  unrelated_p scope MkPerson
  internal unrelated content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestRelationships:
  definition child equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: child_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition step equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: step_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition foster equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: foster_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition grand equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: grand_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition niece equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: niece_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition half_sibling_child equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: half_sibling_child_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition in_law equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: in_law_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition sibling_in_law equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: sibling_in_law_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition parent equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: parent_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition aunt equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: aunt_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition unrelated equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: unrelated_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition step_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.StepChild
  definition foster_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.FosterChild
  definition grand_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.GrandChildOrOtherDescendantOfChild
  definition niece_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.ChildOfSibling
  definition half_sibling_child_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.ChildOfHalfSibling
  definition in_law_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.ChildInLaw
  definition sibling_in_law_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.SiblingInLaw
  definition parent_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Parent
  definition aunt_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.SiblingOfParent
  definition unrelated_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.NoneOfTheAbove
  # 152(c)(2)(A), (B), 152(f)(1), (4)
  assertion child.qualifying_child
  assertion step.qualifying_child
  assertion foster.qualifying_child
  assertion grand.qualifying_child
  assertion niece.qualifying_child
  assertion half_sibling_child.qualifying_child
  # In-laws, ancestors, a parent's sibling and unrelated persons are not in
  # 152(c)(2), whatever their age and residency.
  assertion not in_law.qc_relationship_test
  assertion not in_law.qualifying_child
  assertion not sibling_in_law.qualifying_child
  assertion not parent.qualifying_child
  assertion not aunt.qualifying_child
  assertion not unrelated.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestResidency:
  six_to_eleven_p scope MkPerson
  internal six_to_eleven content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  less_than_six_p scope MkPerson
  internal less_than_six content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestResidency:
  definition six_to_eleven equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: six_to_eleven_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition less_than_six equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: less_than_six_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition six_to_eleven_p.residency_duration equals Q.ResidencyDuration.SixToElevenMonths
  definition less_than_six_p.residency_duration equals Q.ResidencyDuration.LessThanSixMonths
  assertion six_to_eleven.residency_test
  assertion six_to_eleven.qualifying_child
  assertion not less_than_six.residency_test
  assertion not less_than_six.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestOwnSupport:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestOwnSupport:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition c_p.own_support equals true
  assertion not c.qc_support_test
  assertion not c.qualifying_child
```

## Age test details

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestPub501YoungerThanSpouse:
  ex1_p scope MkPerson
  internal ex1 content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  ex2_p scope MkPerson
  internal ex2 content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestPub501YoungerThanSpouse:
  definition ex1 equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: ex1_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |2003-01-10| }
  definition ex2 equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: ex2_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1999-01-10| }
  # Pub 501 p 13, Examples 1 and 2: a 23-year-old unmarried student sibling
  # of a couple filing jointly. Example 1: both spouses are 21, so the
  # oldest filer is 21 and the sibling is not younger. Example 2: the spouse
  # is 25; /minimumFilerDateOfBirth is the 25-year-old's date of birth.
  definition ex1_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Sibling
  definition ex1_p.date_of_birth equals |2001-07-01|
  definition ex1_p.full_time_student equals true
  definition ex2_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Sibling
  definition ex2_p.date_of_birth equals |2001-07-01|
  definition ex2_p.full_time_student equals true
  assertion ex1.age = 23
  assertion not ex1.qualifying_child
  assertion ex2.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestAgeAtFirstHalfOfYear:
  july_2_p scope MkPerson
  internal july_2 content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  july_3_p scope MkPerson
  internal july_3 content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestAgeAtFirstHalfOfYear:
  definition july_2 equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: july_2_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition july_3 equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: july_3_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # DF /ageAtFirstHalfOfYear: the age on July 2.
  definition july_2_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-07-02|
  definition july_3_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-07-03|
  assertion july_2.age_at_first_half_of_year = 18
  assertion july_2.disability_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion july_3.age_at_first_half_of_year = 17
  assertion not july_3.disability_status_may_affect_benefits
  # Both are 18 at the end of the year and pass the age test anyway.
  assertion july_3.age = 18
  assertion july_3.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestDisabledTwinOfFiler:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestDisabledTwinOfFiler:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |2007-03-01| }
  # DF-BUG(16-a): a disabled 17-year-old sibling born the same day as the
  # 17-year-old filer. DF's gate is false (neither older nor younger), so DF
  # fails the age test; 152(c)(3)(B) treats the age requirements as met.
  definition c_p.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Sibling
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2007-03-01|
  definition c_p.permanent_total_disability equals true
  assertion not c.disability_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion c.age_test
  assertion c.qualifying_child

#[test]
declaration scope TestStudentEighteenNotAsked:
  c_p scope MkPerson
  internal c content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestStudentEighteenNotAsked:
  definition c equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: c_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # An 18-year-old student passes under 152(c)(3)(A)(i); DF does not ask the
  # student question under 19, which changes nothing.
  definition c_p.date_of_birth equals |2006-01-15|
  definition c_p.full_time_student equals true
  assertion not c.student_status_may_affect_benefits
  assertion c.age_test
```

## Tie-breaker knockout (IRC 152(c)(4), DF-BUG-3)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestTieBreakerKnockout:
  must_file_p scope MkPerson
  internal must_file content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  files_for_tax_p scope MkPerson
  internal files_for_tax content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  refund_only_p scope MkPerson
  internal refund_only content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  not_filing_p scope MkPerson
  internal not_filing content Q.QualifyingChildTest
  not_my_qc_p scope MkPerson
  internal not_my_qc content Q.QualifyingChildTest

scope TestTieBreakerKnockout:
  definition must_file equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: must_file_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition files_for_tax equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: files_for_tax_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition refund_only equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: refund_only_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition not_filing equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: not_filing_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  definition not_my_qc equals
    output of Q.QualifyingChildTest with {
      -- person: not_my_qc_p.person
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: |1985-06-15| }
  # The other taxpayer must file: a real competing claimant.
  definition must_file_p.could_be_qc_of_another equals true
  definition must_file_p.potential_claimer_must_file equals true
  # Not required to file, but files a return not only for a refund.
  definition files_for_tax_p.could_be_qc_of_another equals true
  definition files_for_tax_p.potential_claimer_did_file equals true
  # Pub 501 p 18: not required to file and files only for a refund.
  definition refund_only_p.could_be_qc_of_another equals true
  definition refund_only_p.potential_claimer_did_file equals true
  definition refund_only_p.potential_claimer_filed_only_for_refund equals true
  # Pub 501 p 18: not required to file and does not file.
  definition not_filing_p.could_be_qc_of_another equals true
  # Not the filer's qualifying child: no tie to break here.
  definition not_my_qc_p.could_be_qc_of_another equals true
  definition not_my_qc_p.potential_claimer_must_file equals true
  definition not_my_qc_p.residency_duration equals Q.ResidencyDuration.LessThanSixMonths

  assertion must_file.qualifying_child
  assertion must_file.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
  assertion files_for_tax.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
  assertion refund_only.qc_of_another_but_not
  assertion not refund_only.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
  assertion not_filing.qc_of_another_but_not
  assertion not not_filing.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
  assertion not not_my_qc.qualifying_child
  assertion not not_my_qc.ko_qualifying_child_tie_breaker
```

## The household

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestHousehold:
  kid scope MkPerson
  student scope MkPerson
  adult scope MkPerson
  parent scope MkPerson
  h scope Q.QualifyingChildren
  tie scope MkPerson
  h_tie scope Q.QualifyingChildren
  h_empty scope Q.QualifyingChildren

scope TestHousehold:
  definition student.date_of_birth equals |2003-09-09|
  definition student.full_time_student equals true
  definition adult.date_of_birth equals |1995-09-09|
  definition parent.relationship equals Q.Relationship.Parent
